# detail
Number of changes: 1

1. Modified | Class definition
   Changed `PoolLimits` from a standalone class to a subclass of `Limits`, and replaced the entire class-body implementation.
   The original implementation included:

   * Constructor: define the parameters `max_keepalive`, `max_connections`, `soft_limit`, and `hard_limit`, set instance attributes, and assign values and call `warn_deprecated` when `soft_limit` or `hard_limit` was provided;
   * Comparison method: define `__eq__`, returning the result of a type check and comparisons of the connection-limit fields.

   The new implementation includes:

   * Constructor: define a `**kwargs` parameter and call `warn_deprecated`.
# /detail
